--TEST--
A declaration that wrote its type out is left alone: the word is already on the line, and a hint beside it would be the editor saying twice what the source says once, `rule:ide/every-feature-is-staged-behind-its-dependency`
--FILE--
<?nvs
int $written = 1;
string $greeting = "hi";
--REQUEST--
inlayHint
--EXPECT--
none
